"total number of elements must be unchanged or :exc:`ValueError` is raised::"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.reshape` vraća polje traženog oblika. Ukupan broj "
"elemenata mora ostati nepromijenjen ili se izaziva :exc:`ValueError`\\ ::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:27
msgid ""
"The result is a view -- ``m`` and ``a`` share data. Writing through ``m[0, "
"0] = 99`` changes ``a[0]`` too."
msgstr ""
"Rezultat je pogled -- ``m`` i ``a`` dijele podatke. Pisanje kroz ``m[0, 0] ="
" 99`` mijenja i ``a[0]``\\ ."

